{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Astaria: a world of surreal, dreamlike beauty, realized by a one-of-a-kind blend of 2D &amp; 3D and an oil-painting artstyle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.poster.avif?t=1772464565\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.webm?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/56619574c071889f1ced1e2e6e197a49.mp4?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Iria, the young, inexperienced moon witch, must grow in the power of her Ghost Hands to have any hope of throwing down with the massive, terrifyingly beautiful \u2014 and beautifully terrifying \u2014 bosses that inhabit Astaria </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.poster.avif?t=1772464565\" width=640 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.webm?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/447b5c3c5ec9dc5280177c5eed1937bb.mp4?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Throughout her journey, Iria will make many allies, and many enemies, but none so magnificent as Isharge, on whose wings she will travel the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.poster.avif?t=1772464565\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.webm?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4028850616dc96421012af9bd84daa7b.mp4?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through new outfits with special abilities, Iria will acquire new powers, new friends to help fight, and most importantly, a current and refined sense of fashion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.poster.avif?t=1772464565\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.webm?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/8ef090ada728eae9ed7638311b21fdfa.mp4?t=1772464565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In her travels, Iria will experience a living planet: changing weather that with it brings new enemies and changes to the environment, as well as moving parallax backgrounds that proclaim the vastness of the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563880/extras/4d24f8f0a2df7574fff05d617c849534.poster.avif?t=1772464565\" width=640 height=298 ><source src=\"https://sha